# WHY: this repo is authored on Windows but every script in it runs on Linux (EC2, Docker).
# A shell script checked out with CRLF fails with "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M", which is a
# baffling error to debug over SSH. Forcing LF on the files that Linux executes removes that
# entire class of problem.
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
Procfile    text eol=lf
